    },
    {
      "id": "capability-tracker-edit",
      "scope": "torrents/editTracker",
      "status": "source-reviewed-partial",
      "findings": "Absent in 4.1.4 controller; 4.1.5 requires hash, origUrl, newUrl. 5.1.4 uses the same names. 5.2.0 replaces origUrl with url and permits newUrl and/or tier. The client separates tracker URL syntax, tier editing, and selected reannounce. Intermediate backend/helper and exact response contracts remain pending.",
