    {
      "id": "capability-5.2-properties",
      "scope": "torrents/pieceAvailability, setComment, selected reannounce",
      "status": "source-reviewed-partial",
      "findings": "5.1.4 lacks pieceAvailability and setComment; reannounce accepts hashes without using urls. 5.2.0 introduces both actions and optional percent-decoded selected tracker urls. Do not substitute all-tracker reannounce for a selected operation. Backend/build restrictions and exact responses remain pending.",
